 for S&R": "ShowText"}, "order": 20}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["", "To create a dynamic and engaging video, consider the following sound effects for each object and background:\n\n1. **Splash Sound Effects**: Use realistic water splash sounds to emphasize the movement of water around the perfume bottle. This can include various intensity levels depending on the size and force of the splash.\n\n2. **Perfume Bottle Sounds**: Add subtle metallic sounds as the cap of the perfume bottle makes contact with the surface or when it is being unscrewed or tightened. These sounds should be soft yet distinct enough to be heard amidst the other elements.\n\n3. **Background Music**:\n   - **Ambient and Atmospheric**: Choose a gentle, ambient track that enhances the luxurious feel of the product without overpowering the visual elements.\n   - **Ethereal Strings**: Incorporate delicate string instrument sounds that evoke elegance and sophistication.\n   - **Minimalist Piano**: A simple, understated piano melody could also work well, adding a touch of class and refinement to the overall presentation.\n\nBy combining these sound effects with appropriate background music, you can create an immersive and visually appealing advertisement that highlights the perfume's elegance and allure."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 25, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [384.2485046386719, 344.8626708984375], "pos": [2850.0078125, 1087.554443359375], "id": 21, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText"}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [{"name": "VIDEO", "links": [27, 33], "label": "VIDEO", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "VIDEO"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["6b6557b6aa049a20f8f2d3727e913edc4debe84540eaf874749193cc430028fa.mp4", "image", ""], "inputs": 